      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This creature appears to be a small cactus made entirely out of gold, having physical characteristics similar to a humanoid: two arms, two legs and dark spots on its anterior in the shape of a mouth, moustache, and eyes. Its limbs protrude and bend at ninety-degree angles giving it a rigid look, which belies the speed and agility with which it can move. - Imban</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 33, touch 20, flat-footed 24 (+8 Dex, +1 dodge, +13 natural, +1 size)</p><p>hp 67 [99] (9d8+27)</p><p>Fort +14, Ref +16, Will +9</p><p>Defensive Abilities Evasion</p><p>DR 10/-; Immune plant traits; Resist All 15</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 60 ft.</p><p>Melee slam +13 (1d4)</p><p>Special Attacks Three Thousand Needles</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 10, Dex 26, Con 16, Int 8, Wis 12, Cha 10</p><p>Base Atk +6; CMB +5; CMD 24</p><p>Feats Dodge, Mobility, Sidestep, Weapon Finesse, Wind Stance</p><p>Skills Escape Artist +9, Perception +11, Stealth +12, Survival +2</p><p>Languages Cactuar</p><p>SQ Resistant, Thorns</p><h2>Ecology</h2><p>Environment any</p><p>Organization solitary, pair, or trio</p><p>Treasure double (100% gil)</p>"
      }
